(164063, 1, 0, 'One less thing to worry about.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Stalker'),
(164064, 0, 0, 'You\'re not one of them. You\'re not one of them!', 14, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 0, 1, 'They killed so many... They ate so many...!', 14, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 1, 0, 'Bless the Light!', 14, 0, 33.3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 1, 1, 'Did... did you kill them? Is it safe to leave?', 14, 0, 33.3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 1, 2, 'You\'ve saved me from something worse than death...', 14, 0, 33.3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 2, 0, 'I thought... I\'d rot in there... Thank you.', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 2, 1, 'I can... I can make it on my own from here... I think... Ah! Thank you...', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 2, 2, 'There are more like me. Dozens of captives...', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164064, 2, 3, 'Don\'t stop until you\'ve killed the very last of those savages...', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Captive Hostage'),
(164066, 0, 0, 'You have come too far. I must kill you, I am sorry. Fight with honor, and you have my word that I will not let them feast upon your body.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Emissary Agramor'),
(164066, 1, 0, 'You fight well! Your leaders are lucky to have you on their side.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Emissary Agramor'),
(164066, 2, 0, 'Ha! I\'ll be needing a witch doctor after this bout.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Emissary Agramor'),
(164066, 3, 0, 'A death... with honor. But...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Emissary Agramor'),
(164067, 0, 0, 'Lead the way, I pray. For no one is an orphan when embraced by the Light.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sister Sarah'),
(164071, 0, 0, 'I\'ve killed so many of ya kind... ya startin\' to bore me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - aggro'),
(164071, 1, 0, 'How many I killed? I lost count a long time ago...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - combat'),
(164071, 1, 1, 'I come from royalty. Ya lot be nothin\' but scum.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - combat'),
(164071, 1, 2, 'Ya fight well, for such scrawny t\'ings!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - combat'),
(164071, 1, 3, 'Ya havin\' fun, Zelezak?', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - combat'),
(164071, 1, 4, 'I be stuffed, but if ya insist... Zelezak always be hungry!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - combat'),
(164071, 2, 0, 'Mexitla, me princess... I failed ya...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - death'),
(164071, 2, 1, 'In de end, ya see... de bridge gonna collapse under de weight of so many bodies...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - death'),
(164071, 3, 0, 'Turn back while ya still can! De dwarves be our real enemy. Ya can keep Scadeald if ya want it so bad...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alta\'zin - approach warning'),
(164074, 0, 0, 'The Spirits smile upon our cause!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 1, 'For the Spirits!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 2, 'Rivers of blood shall flow.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 3, 'City-dwelling scum.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 4, 'Freedom for Scadeald!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 5, 'The Witch will take your children!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 6, 'Death to the Kingdom!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 7, 'You are all intruders in our land.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 8, 'Victory for the Ealdir!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164074, 0, 9, 'Scadeald shall be free!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Scaidern Ealdir'),
(164075, 0, 0, 'Ha! That Graysky strumpet has sent you to your death.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Rallagh'),
(164075, 1, 0, 'I\'ll toss your bones to the dogs!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Rallagh'),
(164075, 1, 1, 'I\'ll mount your head upon a spike!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Rallagh'),
(164075, 1, 2, 'All this... for a mere drop of blood?', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Rallagh'),
(164075, 2, 0, 'When you believe in a cause... you never truly die...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Rallagh'),
