(164204, 1, 3, 'Let my blade speak for my oath!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hallow Wind Initiate - duel start'),
(164204, 1, 4, 'You\'ll see if my devotion is enough!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hallow Wind Initiate - duel start'),
(164204, 2, 0, 'I will redeem this failure. I promise you.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hallow Wind Initiate - defeated'),
(164204, 2, 1, 'May the Light forgive me.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hallow Wind Initiate - defeated'),
(164205, 0, 0, 'Back, monster! I still have the strength to...! Ah, oh. Agh! You... you are not a trogg.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Crusader Diallos - player arrives on 175014'),
(164205, 1, 0, 'Kill them... kill them all... those loathsome beasts. That parody of living beings. Avenge my fallen comrades!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Crusader Diallos - 175015 accepted'),
(164206, 0, 0, 'In accordance with the king\'s justice, your sentence is death.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - aggro'),
(164206, 0, 1, 'Taste the hospitality of Grimepit!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - aggro'),
(164206, 0, 2, 'The crusaders we slew await you in the Shadowlands.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - aggro'),
(164206, 0, 3, 'Intruders! Sound the alarm!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - aggro'),
(164206, 1, 0, 'But... my family...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - death'),
(164206, 1, 1, 'Do not kill... the young...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - death'),
(164206, 1, 2, 'You... are... the invader...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - death'),
(164206, 1, 3, 'I too... had... dreams...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Grimepit Trogg - death'),
(164210, 0, 0, 'You\'re nothing but thugs, do you know that? And what\'s worse: thieves!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'captured in game'),
(164210, 1, 0, 'Though the entries are ambiguous, the journal mentions something about the well and a cave beneath the manor. It might be worth taking a look.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'captured in game'),
(164211, 0, 0, 'And we, I believe, have made ours clear, Lord Darengar.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lord Aldous Bruck'),
(164211, 1, 0, 'Even if there were unanimity, this council cannot simply march the army into Scadeald without the consent of House Coldmere.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lord Aldous Bruck'),
(164211, 2, 0, 'You are wasting your time barking up the wrong tree, Lord Darengar. Our laws exist for a reason. This session is adjourned.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lord Aldous Bruck'),
(164212, 0, 0, 'And do remember that it is the Coldmeres, and not yourself, who rule Scadeald.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Countess Cecilia Clessington'),
(164221, 0, 0, 'Wait! I friend! Friend! Put away weapon, yes?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alto Bilberg - Player in sight'),
(164226, 0, 0, 'Ha! You fight like a shopkeeper!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164226, 0, 1, 'And I challenge you to survive this fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164227, 0, 0, 'Ha! You fight like a shopkeeper!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164227, 0, 1, 'And I challenge you to survive this fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164228, 0, 0, 'Ha! You fight like a shopkeeper!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164228, 0, 1, 'And I challenge you to survive this fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164229, 0, 0, 'Ha! You fight like a shopkeeper!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
