(164231, 0, 1, 'And I challenge you to survive this fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164232, 0, 0, 'Ha! You fight like a shopkeeper!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164232, 0, 1, 'And I challenge you to survive this fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164233, 0, 0, 'Ha! You fight like a shopkeeper!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164233, 0, 1, 'And I challenge you to survive this fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ealdmaine Aspirant'),
(164235, 0, 0, 'Ralda lives in the house on the shore of the lake. Please take the food to her.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Fernad'),
(164236, 0, 0, '¿Dorothy...? Oh...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ralda'),
(164236, 1, 0, 'The murlocs took my little Dorothy!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ralda'),
(164236, 2, 0, 'Any clue about my daughter’s whereabouts would be enough for me...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ralda'),
(164236, 3, 0, 'The kobolds took Dorothy! It was them!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ralda'),
(164236, 4, 0, 'Have you found my daughter?! Any clues?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ralda'),
(164238, 0, 0, 'Ralda... Oh, Ralda!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Rothfuss - Dorothy talk 1/5'),
(164238, 1, 0, 'She\'s had you running all over the place, hasn\'t she? Murlocs, kobolds... She hasn\'t been the same since... Dorothy.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Rothfuss - Dorothy talk 2/5'),
(164238, 2, 0, 'Dorothy didn\'t disappear. No one took her. She died a couple of months ago... she drowned. It was an accident, a moment\'s neglect, but Ralda... she couldn\'t live with the guilt. And the guilt broke her.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Rothfuss - Dorothy talk 3/5'),
(164238, 3, 0, 'At times she convinces herself that Dorothy is still alive. Other times, she curls up into a ball by her grave and sleeps out in the open. I\'ll go back to her as soon as duty allows it.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Rothfuss - Dorothy talk 4/5'),
(164238, 4, 0, 'I\'m sorry... I\'m sorry she dragged you into this.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Rothfuss - Dorothy talk 5/5'),
(164238, 5, 0, 'Head down the stairs to the basement and look for a trapdoor in the floor. It sticks sometimes; don\'t be afraid to give it a good, hard yank.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Rothfuss - On Arathel\'s Camp accepted'),
(164243, 0, 0, 'The orcs have their backs turned to us. They have broad, generous backs... just begging to be stabbed. Seize the opportunity.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Arathel - on quest accept'),
(164247, 0, 0, 'For Kerebor!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 1, 'I\'ll make a trophy out of your skull.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 2, 'Okma´ka!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 3, 'Blue Scum!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 4, 'Vermin!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 5, 'Someone like you stands no chance against me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 6, 'Show me your blood!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 7, 'We will kill you all. Even your children...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164247, 0, 8, 'Death!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Besieger - aggro'),
(164248, 0, 0, 'Have you ever heard the proverb? “Go not to the Elves for counsel, for they will say both no and yes.” Be careful when dealing with them!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ketheric Sadson - on quest accept'),
(164252, 0, 0, 'Once you\'ve filled the amphora, return to the fortress. This enchanted water can mend even the foulest wound and cure the most pernicious disease; dispense it with measure.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sanadriel - on quest accept'),
(164253, 0, 0, 'Death!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 1, 'Okma´ka!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 2, 'For Kerebor!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 3, 'I hope you last longer than the last one. Don\'t piss yourself!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 4, 'I\'ll make a trophy out of your skull.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 5, 'We will kill you all. Even your children...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 6, 'Someone like you stands no chance against me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 7, 'Lok-tar!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164253, 0, 8, 'Vermin!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Orc - aggro'),
(164254, 0, 0, 'Wait, wait! Do you go first, or do I?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - duel start'),
(164254, 1, 0, 'The sword might be fancy and all, but I\'m used to a rake. And believe me, I\'d fight better with one than with this!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - during the duel'),
(164254, 1, 1, 'Why did they recruit us from so far away if they already have you here?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - during the duel'),
(164254, 2, 0, 'Perhaps I can still be useful to the cause after this humiliation... as cannon fodder.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - yields'),
(164254, 2, 1, 'I think... I think the urge to fight has left me.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - yields'),
