(164261, 1, 1, 'Why did they recruit us from so far away if they already have you here?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - during the duel'),
(164261, 2, 0, 'Perhaps I can still be useful to the cause after this humiliation... as cannon fodder.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - yields'),
(164261, 2, 1, 'I think... I think the urge to fight has left me.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Andraste Recruit - yields'),
(164262, 0, 0, 'A word of advice from a veteran: climb the ruined siege tower to slip into Kerebor. That is, if you\'re looking to keep the noise down.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Arendor - accepts The Three of Kerebor'),
(164265, 0, 0, 'Treacherous carrion! I will kill you. I will butcher you. And then...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Butcher Eigor - aggro'),
(164265, 1, 0, 'What I do with your remains next will sicken the spirits of your ancestors!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Butcher Eigor - follows the aggro yell');
INSERT INTO `creature_text` (`CreatureID`, `GroupID`, `ID`, `Text`, `Type`, `Language`, `Probability`, `Emote`, `Duration`, `Sound`, `BroadcastTextId`, `TextRange`, `comment`) VALUES
(164266, 0, 0, 'Ah, just when the sacrifices were running thin... Come with me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Karegor Grimfang - aggro'),
(164266, 1, 0, 'It is a small thing I require; only... your soul.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Karegor Grimfang - follows the aggro yell'),
(164267, 0, 0, 'Blood. Soft skins. And pants soiled with fear. Just the way I like it.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - aggro'),
(164267, 0, 1, 'Have a few of my men died for you to reach me? Good. You save me the trouble of weeding out the weak myself.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - aggro'),
(164267, 0, 2, 'When I am through with you... what I will do to you... not even necromancy will be able to bring you back.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - aggro'),
(164267, 1, 0, 'I will rain your corpses upon the Fortress of Andraste.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - combat'),
(164267, 1, 1, 'You made me bleed? Ha!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - combat'),
(164267, 1, 2, 'Those who sent you, those SI:7 rats... your corpses will serve as their warning.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - combat'),
(164267, 2, 0, 'A noisy... death... Just the way she likes it... Ha...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - death'),
(164267, 3, 0, 'Fort Kerebor will be your tomb.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blackrock Champion Kurgan - follows the aggro yell'),
(164269, 0, 0, 'Northshire is but a stone\'s throw away...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Spy - aggro'),
(164269, 0, 1, 'Have you ever had your throat slit? There\'s a first time for everything...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Spy - aggro'),
(164269, 0, 2, 'I want to see your blood splatter.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Spy - aggro'),
(164269, 0, 3, 'She... She will want me to bring her your head.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Spy - aggro'),
(164269, 0, 4, 'Fools... We are only the rearguard', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Spy - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 0, 'Death!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 1, 'Show me your blood!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 2, 'We will kill you all. Even your children...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 3, 'Blue Scum!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 4, 'Lok-tar!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 5, 'Someone like you stands no chance against me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 6, 'Vermin!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 7, 'Okma´ka!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164270, 0, 8, 'I hope you last longer than the last one. Don\'t piss yourself!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Infiltrator - aggro'),
(164271, 0, 0, 'Blue Scum!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Guard - aggro'),
(164271, 0, 1, 'I hope you last longer than the last one. Don\'t piss yourself!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Guard - aggro'),
(164271, 0, 2, 'I\'ll make a trophy out of your skull.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Guard - aggro'),
(164271, 0, 3, 'Show me your blood!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Guard - aggro'),
(164271, 0, 4, 'For Kerebor!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Guard - aggro'),
(164271, 0, 5, 'Death!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kerebor Guard - aggro'),
(164274, 0, 0, 'Your spirit will serve as tinder for us.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shadowburn Prospector - aggro'),
(164274, 0, 1, 'I don\'t intend to dig a grave to bury you. You\'ll be fodder for the vultures.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shadowburn Prospector - aggro'),
(164274, 0, 2, 'An unfortunate encounter. The Guild\'s protocol regarding meddlers is... death.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shadowburn Prospector - aggro'),
(164274, 0, 3, 'Understand this... we follow a strict zero-witness policy.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shadowburn Prospector - aggro'),
(164278, 0, 0, 'The Treants will be hostile; do not fear to meet their violence with your own. The spell within the crystal will only work on them if you weaken them first.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lady Amaranthe Naemyl - On Anger Not Easily Appeased accepted'),
(164278, 1, 0, 'I myself helped Cauranos weave the protective enchantments of the Chambers of Erdaya. We both understood the danger they held; the dark attention they might attract. If the Blood Elves have risked so much to force their way into them...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lady Amaranthe Naemyl - On The Chambers of Erdaya accepted (1/2)'),
(164278, 2, 0, 'Their ambition is clear: to release the prisoner from its cage. That which the yeti call the Black Snow. That which the Ealdir know as the Rooted Shadow. Titles. I shall not utter its true name, lest I darken the light of day.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lady Amaranthe Naemyl - On The Chambers of Erdaya accepted (2/2)'),
(164278, 3, 0, 'Depart with the blessing of the Sanctuary and the gratitude of all the elves who dwell here.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lady Amaranthe Naemyl - On Blessed Seed of a New Beginning accepted'),
(164278, 4, 0, 'I know what you have seen. For it is also in my mind. You have saved the valley, $n. More than the valley. Though the price paid has been steep.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lady Amaranthe Naemyl - Player with The Cult Patriarch complete in sight'),
(164302, 0, 0, 'The death of the Magisters will not suffice to calm the forest if the vile magic of their crystals continues to drain the valley\'s vitality. Make sure to destroy them.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Cauranos - 175097 accepted'),
(164302, 1, 0, 'The Blood Elves and their irresponsible thirst for magic jeopardize the balance of the forest.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Cauranos - 175098 accepted'),
(164302, 2, 0, 'Eons ago, the Titans excavated a prison beneath these lands. Just as a sieve serves to sift wheat, the trees of this forest sift the energy that emanates from it. The Sanctuary elves know this. And it is possible the Blood Elves do as well; in which case, the Magisters were nothing more than a distraction. You must warn Lady Amaranthe at once.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Cauranos - 175099 accepted'),
(164302, 3, 0, 'Peace, friends! Not everyone here is our enemy. Come closer, do not fear. Your heart is noble. Have you come to aid us?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Cauranos - greeting'),
(164305, 0, 0, 'Here. I\'m wounded.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Meredyl Sunheart - approach'),
(164305, 1, 0, 'Cursed sprites... watch out for them, will you? Something must have driven them mad. The valley is living through strange times...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Meredyl Sunheart - 175095 accepted'),
(164309, 0, 0, 'Kill them. All of them. End them. Lay a carpet of corpses from here to their leader. And kill him too.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Enilith Naemyl - On A Cult Within the Embassy accepted'),
(164309, 1, 0, 'Curse you...! When the Dark Lady hears of this treachery... there will be no corner of Azeroth where you can escape her wrath.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Enilith Naemyl - Player on The Chambers of Erdaya in sight'),
(164310, 0, 0, 'May the Shadow devour you!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Zealot - On Aggro'),
(164310, 0, 1, 'I shall hurl your corpse into the pit with the others!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Zealot - On Aggro'),
(164310, 0, 2, 'You are too late!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Zealot - On Aggro'),
(164310, 0, 3, 'You will not stand between the Kin and its aspirations!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Zealot - On Aggro'),
(164312, 0, 0, 'May the Shadow devour you!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Cultist - On Aggro'),
(164312, 0, 1, 'I shall hurl your corpse into the pit with the others!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Cultist - On Aggro'),
(164312, 0, 2, 'You are too late!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Cultist - On Aggro'),
(164312, 0, 3, 'You will not stand between the Kin and its aspirations!', 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Family Cultist - On Aggro'),
(164314, 0, 0, 'It matters little. I am almost finished. It is inside me now! It writhes. It frolics. It kicks. Oh...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Patriarch Tharion - On Aggro'),
(164314, 1, 0, 'That wet sound... it is the blood you weep.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Patriarch Tharion - At 66% HP'),
(164314, 2, 0, 'You will die down here, where no Light can find you.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Patriarch Tharion - At 33% HP'),
(164314, 3, 0, 'The Family... staked everything... on this move...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Patriarch Tharion - On Death'),
(164317, 0, 0, 'For the Spirits!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 1, 'City-dwelling scum.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 2, 'The Spirits smile upon our cause!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 3, 'Victory for the Ealdir!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 4, 'You are all intruders in our land.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 5, 'Rivers of blood shall flow.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 6, 'The Witch will take your children!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164317, 0, 7, 'Death to the Kingdom!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kharadol Ealdir - aggro'),
(164327, 0, 0, 'I am sorry I cannot be of more use. I saw so little... I just ran. The Ealdir took everyone else. Do you... do you think they are still alive?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mayv - 175110 accepted'),
(164339, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Saidarn has a reputation for being cruel and impatient; he rarely stays in one place for long. You\'ll have to scour Braicag Heights to track him down.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Laurelin - On Chieftain Saidarn accepted'),
(164340, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma is a powerful witch. Even if you manage to catch her unawares, it would be a grave mistake to underestimate her.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Telperion - On The Witch of My Nightmares accepted'),
(164340, 1, 0, 'Once you have drawn near to Baile Escada, simply rub the amulet to trigger the spell and take your cat form. It goes without saying, but... the Ealdir are no fools, and the magic they wield is no parlor trick. Tread carefully.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Telperion - On The Ealdir of Baile Escada accepted'),
(164341, 0, 0, 'Rivers of blood shall flow.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 1, 'Death to the Kingdom!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 2, 'You are all intruders in our land.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 3, 'For the Spirits!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 4, 'The Witch will take your children!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 5, 'Freedom for Scadeald!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 6, 'City-dwelling scum.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 7, 'Scadeald shall be free!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 8, 'Victory for the Ealdir!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164341, 0, 9, 'The Spirits smile upon our cause!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Braicag Ealdir - Aggro'),
(164342, 0, 0, 'Ah! I thought I heard the whispering of rats! Come then! Face me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Saidarn - Aggro'),
(164342, 1, 0, 'The Spirits are generous indeed! At last, a challenge worthy of Scaidarn!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Saidarn - At half health'),
(164342, 2, 0, 'Ah... Such strength... it is worthy... of a Chieftain...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chieftain Saidarn - Death'),
(164344, 0, 0, 'What have we here? More naughty children to toss in the pot? My belly was just beginning to growl!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma - Aggro'),
(164344, 1, 0, 'You\'ll never live to be as old as you look, my pretties! Ha!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma - Combat'),
(164344, 1, 1, 'I brewed a lovely broth from the bones of the last brat who knocked on my door. Think how much tastier a seasoned little morsel like you will be!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma - Combat'),
(164344, 1, 2, 'I\'ll turn you into flies to feed my toads. They do love a snack that\'s still twitching!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma - Combat'),
(164344, 1, 3, 'Are you so eager to meet the One who drools with a hundred mouths and stomps with a hundred hooves beneath Scadeald? I\'m sure it\'s famished!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma - Combat'),
(164344, 2, 0, 'Ha! I go to my grave laughing... knowing the treat that\'s waiting for the likes of you!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bagga Darma - Death'),
(164345, 0, 0, 'First my son, when the guard attacked Valten Village. And then my grandson, for wanting to avenge his father. Do not speak to me of sacrifices, nor of causes, Mindra. The witches are only willing to buy Scadeald\'s freedom if it is with our blood.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Baig Dyras'),
(164346, 0, 0, 'I would be careful in your place, Baig. The Coven has ears everywhere. Besides, everyone says the war is about to end thanks to the Great Mother. And then, will we have peace.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mindra Roble'),
(164347, 0, 0, 'Spirits of the Woods. Great Stag, Dire Wolf, Grandmother Spider. Answer my call.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Goldarn'),
(164347, 1, 0, 'Why does the earth scream and cry out? Why are the elements restless? Is the source that ritual? Morgwena\'s dread plan?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Goldarn'),
(164355, 0, 0, 'What have we here? Oh, if it isn\'t the loveliest cat I\'ve ever laid eyes on.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164355, 1, 0, 'We Ealdir have been at war for centuries. My grandmothers, and theirs before them, and theirs before them... we all share the same contempt for Stormwind, for Graysky. For your religion, your customs. Your zealotry.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164355, 2, 0, 'I cannot say for certain, but whispers among the sisters suggest Morgwena intends to unleash the Rooted Shadow; the darkest spirit in our pantheon.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164355, 3, 0, 'Should that be true, and should she succeed... we are all as good as dead. In Scadeald, in Stormwind, and across every neighboring land for leagues around.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164355, 4, 0, 'Morgwena\'s loyalists took the captives of Rockrend to the Shadowbone Depths, to the west of here. However, a powerful ward protects those caverns. I shall require Morgwena\'s grimoire to find a way through her defenses and put a stop to this ritual.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164355, 5, 0, 'Present the amulet at the Altar of the Great Stag, upon the highest point of the crag.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164355, 6, 0, 'Serenya Coldmere\'s life for Morgwena\'s. The leader of Graysky and the leader of the Ealdir. And then, when both are cold in the ground... peace. Or something like it, at least. For a time.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Deirdre'),
(164376, 0, 0, 'If, while traveling the Winding Road, you find anything capable of shedding light on who was behind the attack, present your findings to Senator Thargas Anvilmar.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mountaineer Captain Kildar - Bitter Legacy of the War accepted'),
(164377, 0, 0, '<The body of a dwarf dressed in the colors and honors befitting an Ironforge diplomat. It is curious; all the corpses belong to members of the diplomatic corps. Did not a single ambusher die? How, then, did the other survivors of the convoy escape?>', 42, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ironforge Diplomatic - corpse inspected'),
(164393, 0, 0, 'Alerts and more alerts! The Tram\'s underwater glass is in critical condition!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mekgineer Naudin Screwdriver - player arrives'),
(164399, 0, 0, 'Survivors? Ah, no. You\'re from the outside, then. You\'ve come to die.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sardragar - aggro'),
(164399, 1, 0, 'Let the Shadow take you!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sardragar - combat'),
(164399, 1, 1, 'Your soul isn\'t headed anywhere pleasant. It shall be consumed by Shadow and Flame', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sardragar - combat'),
(164399, 2, 0, 'The damage... is already done...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sardragar - death'),
(164431, 0, 0, 'One less thing to worry about.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 1, 'For de Frostmane!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 2, 'I ain\'t afraid of ya!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 3, 'Ya death brings us closer to de Glory Days!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 4, 'I won\'t leave a body for ya loved ones to weep over...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 5, 'We gonna kill ya all. Startin\' wit\' you!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 6, 'What made ya think ya could beat me?', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 7, 'Ya gonna pay for what ya ancestors stole from us!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164431, 0, 8, 'Dese lands be ours!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bonesurper Troll - aggro yell'),
(164432, 0, 0, 'How fittin\', dyin\' in a tomb...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Necrotic Witch Altamira - yell'),
(164432, 0, 1, 'De Father of Sleep be waitin\' for ya!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Necrotic Witch Altamira - yell'),
(164432, 0, 2, 'Ah, a gift from de Friend of de Night. More souls for ma harem!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Necrotic Witch Altamira - yell'),
(164433, 0, 0, 'Hold, troll scum! Stand down or we\'ll blow your—! Oh.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Guard Captain Erdruin'),
(164433, 1, 0, 'Slay them. Show them the same mercy they showed our kin and scatter their remains across the mountainside!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Guard Captain Erdruin'),
(164438, 0, 0, 'De Princess got powerful allies...', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 1, 'For Mexitla!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 2, 'Ya children gonna grow up orphans...', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 3, 'For de Frostmane!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 4, 'I bet ya taste good... let me have a bite!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 5, 'I got de blessin\' of de Loa!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 6, 'I won\'t leave a body for ya loved ones to weep over...', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 7, 'For de Ancient Empire!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 8, 'Druk\'thar endures!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 9, 'Die!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 10, 'We gonna kill ya all. Startin\' wit\' you!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 11, 'Ya death brings us closer to de Glory Days!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 12, 'What made ya think ya could beat me?', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 13, 'No mercy!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 14, 'I\'ve killed dozens of ya kind... why ya don\'t just give up?', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 15, 'Victory for Mexitla!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 16, 'I\'m gonna eat it all! Bones included!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 17, 'I ain\'t afraid of ya!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 18, 'Dese lands be ours!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 0, 19, 'Ya gonna pay for what ya ancestors stole from us!', 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164438, 1, 0, 'One less thing to worry about.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Raider'),
(164441, 0, 0, 'Thought we\'d killed ya all. Glad we didn\'t... I be startin\' to get bored!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Frostmane Taskmaster Migbala - aggro'),
(164443, 0, 0, 'You\'ve made a mistake coming here.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164443, 0, 1, 'Lok\'tar Ogar!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164443, 0, 2, 'Think you\'ve got what it takes? Prove it!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164443, 0, 3, 'Die!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164443, 0, 4, 'For the Horde!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164444, 0, 0, 'You\'ve made a mistake coming here.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164444, 0, 1, 'Lok\'tar Ogar!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164444, 0, 2, 'Think you\'ve got what it takes? Prove it!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164444, 0, 3, 'Die!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164444, 0, 4, 'For the Horde!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164445, 0, 0, 'You\'ve made a mistake coming here.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164445, 0, 1, 'Lok\'tar Ogar!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164445, 0, 2, 'Think you\'ve got what it takes? Prove it!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164445, 0, 3, 'Die!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164445, 0, 4, 'For the Horde!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164446, 0, 0, 'You\'ve made a mistake coming here.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164446, 0, 1, 'Lok\'tar Ogar!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164446, 0, 2, 'Think you\'ve got what it takes? Prove it!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164446, 0, 3, 'Die!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164446, 0, 4, 'For the Horde!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Horde Collaborator - aggro'),
(164448, 0, 0, 'Back! Back, you insects! Or I shall not have the mercy to refrain from crushing you underfoot.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Elder Thrymus the Astray - aggro'),
(164454, 0, 0, 'We are gathered here to bid farewell to the soul of Holdor Stonefist, champion of Dun Kazad.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bishop Beorn - Farewell Ceremony sermon'),
(164454, 1, 0, 'Therefore, just as the Light lifts his spirit to the empyrean heights, we lift our prayers to accompany him.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bishop Beorn - Farewell Ceremony sermon'),
(164454, 2, 0, 'Beyond pain and sorrow. To that place where all is bliss and contentment.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bishop Beorn - Farewell Ceremony sermon'),
(164454, 3, 0, 'By the grace of the Light, he is now one with the Holy.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bishop Beorn - Farewell Ceremony sermon'),
(164469, 0, 0, 'At last, someone who knows how to fight!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shadowburn Outrider - aggro yell'),
(164518, 0, 0, 'A shattered barrel, left out in the open for quite some time.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Smashed Barrel clue'),
(164518, 1, 0, 'Remains of raw fish, half-buried in the mud. The stench is unbearable.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Raw fish clue'),
(164518, 2, 0, 'Fish skewered on a murloc spear. A scene as vulgar as it is unpleasant.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Skewered fish clue'),
(164518, 3, 0, 'A single boot, caked in mud and bent at the ankle. Judging by the size, it belonged to an adult.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Boot clue'),
(164518, 4, 0, 'A crude tool of murloc make. It shows no signs of use.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Murloc Tool clue'),
(164520, 0, 0, 'A worn pickaxe, its head chipped and its handle covered in grime. You’ve seen hundreds like it.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Pickaxe clue'),
(164520, 1, 0, 'A yellowed kobold skull. There’s no trace of the rest of the body.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kobold Skull clue'),
(164520, 2, 0, 'An improvised ladder built by kobolds. Flimsy, yes; clever as well.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ladder clue'),
(164520, 3, 0, 'A ramshackle mining cart, patched with splintered wood and rusted nails. Nothing out of the ordinary.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Kobold Cart clue'),
(164520, 4, 0, 'The blade of the shovel is so worn it looks older than the kingdom of Stormwind.', 41, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shovel clue'),
(164588, 0, 0, 'Come forward, young one. The dust on your feet pleases us. You have traveled far to reach this place, and for a noble cause.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Maiden - greeting on arrival'),
(164589, 0, 0, 'Come forward, young one. The dust on your feet pleases us. You have traveled far to reach this place, and for a noble cause.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mother - greeting on arrival'),
(164590, 0, 0, 'Come forward, young one. The dust on your feet pleases us. You have traveled far to reach this place, and for a noble cause.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Crone - greeting on arrival'),
(164593, 0, 0, 'Find Cathal in Graysky once you have the blessings. Tell him I sent you, and he\'ll help you find the Three Sisters.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aisling - On Triple Blessing accepted'),
(164593, 1, 0, 'Alanna... I always knew that Carden fellow would be your doom.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aisling - On hearing of Alanna'),
(164594, 0, 0, 'Ekatia, you say? You\'ve got some nerve, asking for an audience. Very well, then. This amuses me! Hold still a moment, will you?', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ann'),
(164597, 0, 0, 'Once you\'re in the cellar, look for a trapdoor in the floor. Then follow the path through the gorge to the Cave of the First Spell.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Cathal'),
(164806, 0, 0, 'What transpired in Gnomeregan was the gnomes\' own doing, but they were not the only ones to pay the price.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 1, 0, 'That green blight, the radiation, seeped and bled through the earth until, at last, it reached the Temple of Matlacan.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 2, 0, 'And the Loa of the Rivers was driven mad.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 3, 0, 'His hunger became a hideous, bloated thing. His body and spirit swelled like a slug and burst like a festering pustule.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 4, 0, 'Yet, Matlacan\'s devotees saw this tragedy as a trial of faith, and they embraced the radiation as something sacred.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 5, 0, 'They call themselves the Sicklight Children. For some time now, they have waged a civil war against the rest of the Frostmanes, serving the erratic, bottomless appetite of their Loa.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 6, 0, 'And with every passing day, their numbers grow.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164806, 7, 0, 'Here you are. Closer, now... come closer. I only bite when I\'m famished.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Anzuldin, Leopard Loa'),
(164981, 0, 0, 'At the rate those lot take to lift a finger, I\'ll starve to death first...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Baldur'),
(164982, 0, 0, 'I hope it is soon...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jelena Goret'),
(164983, 0, 0, 'Damn nobles. We suffer the consequences of their inaction... They never rise to the occasion, but you certainly feel their hand in your pocket.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gareth Lindgren'),
(164984, 0, 0, 'Words, as always... We shall see if they mean anything this time.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sereniel'),
(164985, 0, 0, 'The Light guides us even in times of uncertainty. I trust in that.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Brother Caesar');
