(100729, 'Few eyes have ever rested upon our cauldron. Few breaths have drawn in its scent.$b$bDo you understand the privilege you enjoy? Others would kill for an audience with us.', 'Few eyes have ever rested upon our cauldron. Few breaths have drawn in its scent.$b$bDo you understand the privilege you enjoy? Others would kill for an audience with us.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(100730, 'We are the Three Sisters. We were here before the trees took root or the stones were cast, and we shall remain long after the mountains crumble to dust and the seas go dry. Such is our nature.', 'We are the Three Sisters. We were here before the trees took root or the stones were cast, and we shall remain long after the mountains crumble to dust and the seas go dry. Such is our nature.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(100731, 'We support no one\'s cause, for no one supports ours. Long has it been since the Ealdir had hearts for anything but war. Few remember us; fewer still honor us. We were guides once, protectors! But far off are the days when we instructed the witches; when we taught the Ealdir to listen to the wind, and the river, and the stones. Scadeald drove them away from us. Scadeald darkened their thoughts. And it began with her. It began with Morgwena.', 'We support no one\'s cause, for no one supports ours. Long has it been since the Ealdir had hearts for anything but war. Few remember us; fewer still honor us. We were guides once, protectors! But far off are the days when we instructed the witches; when we taught the Ealdir to listen to the wind, and the river, and the stones. Scadeald drove them away from us. Scadeald darkened their thoughts. And it began with her. It began with Morgwena.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(100732, 'Human?$b$b<The three laugh in unison with voices sweet, deep, and raspy, respectively.>$b$bNo. The stars had not yet blinked awake when we first opened our eyes. The world was not yet round. We were not yet three...', 'Human?$b$b<The three laugh in unison with voices sweet, deep, and raspy, respectively.>$b$bNo. The stars had not yet blinked awake when we first opened our eyes. The world was not yet round. We were not yet three...', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
